    "result": "illustrations/ramen/5.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 5,
   "part": "Broth",
   "part_id": "part-broth",
   "time": "6–8 h",
   "time_html": "<span>6–8 h</span>",
   "title": "Stage 2 — pork + ginger + garlic, 6–8 hours",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lift the pork bones, ginger and garlic out with the spider.</li><li>Add:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>beef neck bones <span class=\"amt\">about as much as the chicken</span></li></ul></li><li>Medium to bring it up, then low again, topping up as needed — by the end it’s rich and cloudy.</li></ul>",
